+/* Rewrite a BF16 buffer as IEEE FP16 in place, element-wise.
+ *
+ * FP16 keeps 10 mantissa bits against BF16's 7, so every BF16 value inside
+ * FP16's exponent range converts exactly; the only lossy cases are magnitudes
+ * >= 65504 (counted below, clamped to +-HALF_MAX) and subnormals under 2^-14
